<h1>Visiting the workshop</h1>

<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-4">
    <h2>Where we are</h2>
    <p>42 Harbour Lane, on the corner of Mill Street. Street parking out front, bike racks by the door.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4">
    <h2>Opening hours</h2>
    <p>Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00. Saturday, 10:00 to 14:00. Closed Sundays.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-4">
    <h2>Bringing a bike in</h2>
    <p>When you drop a bike off we register the owner's name and phone, the bike's make, model and serial number, and give you a promised-ready date. For anything beyond a minor job, you approve the estimate before any work begins.</p>
  </div>
</div>
